The results that can be found in this folder concerns the two coupled equations between the plasma electron density rho and the envelope of the electric field E

The first equation, for the envelope of the electric field, contains all the terms, i.e, transversal diffraction, GVD, Kerr, MPA, and plasma term

The second equation, for the plasma electron density, contains the ionization avalanche and the MPA avalanche, and not the readiative recombination as this 
neglectable

The sweep was done from Pin = 0.1 * Pcr to 20 * Pcr with increments of 0.1 * Pcr
